@startuml
title COM1-ES — RM-ODP Information Viewpoint Projection

class "Candidate Framed Interaction\nINF-OBJ-01" as Candidate {
  declaredExtent
  receivedExtent
  interactionContext
}

class "Declared Message Extent\nINF-OBJ-02" as Extent {
  declaredExtent : integer
}

class "Message Payload\nINF-OBJ-03" as Payload {
  orderedPayloadUnits
  receivedExtent : integer
}

class "Admission Outcome\nINF-OBJ-04" as Admission {
  status : Admitted | Rejected
}

class "Complete Admitted Message\nINF-OBJ-05" as Complete

class "Interaction Response\nINF-OBJ-06" as Response

class "Interaction Failure Outcome\nINF-OBJ-07" as Failure

Candidate *-- Extent
Candidate *-- Payload
Candidate --> Admission : evaluated as
Admission --> Complete : if admitted\nand complete
Complete --> Response : enables
Candidate --> Failure : may produce

note top of Candidate
INF-INIT-01
Initial Interaction State

- no active candidate
- no admitted message
- no complete message
- no successful response
- no failure outcome
- receivedExtent = 0
end note

note left of Extent
INF-INV-01
declaredExtent >= 0

INF-INV-02
admission only within
supported bound
end note

note left of Payload
INF-INV-03
0 <= receivedExtent
<= declaredExtent

INF-INV-05
receivedExtent < declaredExtent
=> no complete message
end note

note right of Admission
INF-INV-06
Rejected interaction
=> no complete message
end note

note right of Complete
INF-INV-04
Complete exists only if:
Admission = Admitted
and
receivedExtent = declaredExtent
end note

note right of Response
INF-INV-07
Successful response only if
Complete Admitted Message exists
end note

note bottom of Failure
INF-INV-08
Failure of one interaction
does not invalidate subsequent
independent interactions
end note

note bottom
Dynamic schema:

INF-DYN-01 Submit Candidate Interaction
INF-DYN-02 Evaluate Admission
INF-DYN-03 Accumulate Message Payload
INF-DYN-04 Establish Complete Admitted Message
INF-DYN-05 Produce Interaction Response
INF-DYN-06 Fail Interaction
end note

@enduml
